some side comments on wizard mode:

- the Olog-hai still comes back *after* being canned
- can wish for more that one Olog-hai figurines 
- can create a monster (^G) of the Wizard of Yendor, kill him, can him, box him,
  and he'll still come back (having "killed" him at his liar to get the Amulet
  of Y.)
- cannot level teleport (^V) after getting the amulet
- cannot wish for figurines of Wizard of Yendor, can get wizard of Yendor (an
  ordinary wizard only)
- can wish for traps
- strangely pets like dwarves, trolls drop their armors and weapons once they
  once transformed from figurines


